<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 2.0 bln in nine-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 2.0 bln in nine-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of nine-year bonds. Bids have to be entered by 1130 GMT on January 29, the day of the auction.</p>
<p>Loan 1038</p>
<p>    Auction date			     January 29, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity date			    October 25, 2006</p>
<p>    Coupon  (pct)			    6.50</p>
<p>    Amount to the market (billions)    2.0</p>
<p>    Settlement date			  February 3, 1997</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
